/*⁣‍‌‌⁠‍‍⁠​​‌⁠​‌​​⁠⁠⁠‍‍⁠​​⁠⁠⁠​‍‌‌⁠⁠‍‌‌​‍⁠⁠​⁠‌⁠​‍⁠‌⁠‌‌​‍​‌‌‍‌⁠​‌‍‍‌​⁣ 1. 顶部 Mac 标题栏 MiMi */
.xt-root::before {
    content: "MiMi";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 32px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f2f2f2, #dcdcdc);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #b5b5b5;
    border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 32px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #333;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

/* 2. 左上角红黄绿控制按钮 */
.xt-root::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px; left: 14px;
    width: 12px; height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #ff5f56;
    box-shadow: 18px 0 0 #ffbd2e, 36px 0 0 #27c93f, 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
